{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/guide/layout,_N_T_/guide/page,_N_T_/guide"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/brand/tradeboss-logo.png\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4c932179cb6a336b.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/guide/page-d52b5074c6cdd6ee.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>新手導覽 | 股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"先做下面三步。不用一次看完全站。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><div class=\"compliance-bar border-b border-line/40 bg-bg/60 px-4 py-1 text-center text-[10.5px] leading-tight text-muted/70\">非證券投資顧問事業<span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">｜公開資料研究與教學，不提供個股分析意見或推介</span><span class=\"sm:hidden\">｜公開資料研究與教學</span> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/legal\">法遵</a> · <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/privacy\">隱私</a></div><header class=\"Navigation_header__9xJIy\"><div class=\"Navigation_inner__HaQCh\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Navigation_backBtn__rNB5u\" aria-label=\"返回上一頁\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M228,128a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H69l51.52,51.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17l-72-72a12,12,0,0,1,0-17l72-72a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L69,116H216A12,12,0,0,1,228,128Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"Navigation_brand__V_MfK\" aria-label=\"回股市大佬首頁\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/tradeboss-logo.png\" alt=\"股市大佬 TradeBoss\" class=\"Navigation_logoImg___eeKZ\"/><span class=\"Navigation_brandText__c1Rib\"><span class=\"Navigation_brandTitle__V8fwH\">股市<span class=\"Navigation_brandAccent__bb15A\">大佬</span></span><span class=\"Navigation_brandSub__XUkO_\">TRADEBOSS</span></span></a><nav class=\"Navigation_nav__D1U__\"><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/learn\">文章</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/school\">學堂</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/about\">關於</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/login\">登入</a></nav><div class=\"Navigation_actions__QSJSs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Navigation_themeBtn__I9ble\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"切換到淺色（較亮、較清楚）\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Navigation_themeGlyph__wvU6O\">☀</span><span class=\"Navigation_srOnly__lixg9\">切換淺色</span></button><a class=\"Navigation_loginMobile__J3HwV\" href=\"/login\">登入</a></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"StaticPage_page__Pk04n\"><nav aria-label=\"相關功能切換\" class=\"StaticPage_subNav__46on3\"><div class=\"StaticPage_subNavTrack__6PS6N\"><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/learn\">文章</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/school\">學堂</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/sim\">練功房</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/diary\">猜K線</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 StaticPage_pillActive__LSFUD\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/diary\">新手</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/diary\">手冊</a></div></nav><div class=\"StaticPage_enter__wb_uk\"><section class=\"StaticPage_hero__awFjR\"><p class=\"StaticPage_heroEyebrow___LUoy\">TRADEBOSS</p><h1 class=\"StaticPage_heroTitle__5tyIo\">新手導覽</h1><p class=\"StaticPage_heroLead__TNPFm\">先做下面三步。不用一次看完全站。</p><div class=\"StaticPage_heroCtas__54QbZ\"><a class=\"StaticPage_ctaPrimary__4x_E8\" href=\"/diary\">先看今日戰情</a><a class=\"StaticPage_ctaSecondary__5LexN\" href=\"/diary\">還沒登入</a></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">三步上手</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ StaticPage_cardAccent__F9F_l\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardEyebrow__yesew\">第 1 步</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">先看今天盤面與精華</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">「今日戰情」最上面寫漲跌家數；首頁「今日精華」再收幾張客觀摘要卡。只描述今天，不代表接下來比較好做。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/diary\">打開今日戰情 →</a></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ StaticPage_cardAccent__F9F_l\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardEyebrow__yesew\">第 2 步</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">掃一眼產業與族群</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">產業地圖看上下游與成分熱力；族群熱圖看相對強弱。兩邊可以互相跳轉對照。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/diary\">打開產業地圖 →</a></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ StaticPage_cardAccent__F9F_l\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardEyebrow__yesew\">第 3 步</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">不懂的詞去學堂查</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">融資維持率、今日精華、產業地圖、1 分 K 與 5 分 K，都用白話寫。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/school\">打開台股學堂 →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">七天新手路徑</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">第 1 天：先看盤勢與今日精華</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">只核對漲跌家數、資料日與首頁精華，不猜明天。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/diary\">今日戰情</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>第 1 天：先看盤勢與今日精華只核對漲跌家數、資料日與首頁精華，不猜明天。今日戰情首頁精華學堂：今日精華</li><li>第 2 天：產業地圖與族群熱圖先看整條產業鏈與族群相對強弱，再決定要不要進個股。產業地圖族群熱圖學堂：產業地圖</li><li>第 3 天：分點與集中度是什麼先懂名詞，再去看排行才不會把「某分點」當成單一主力。學堂：分點學堂：集中度分點排行</li><li>第 4 天：查一檔：總覽與風險個股頁先看摘要與風險，再決定要不要往下翻。查 2330學堂：風險處置股名單</li><li>第 5 天：盤後整理與自選到價日報是當日客觀摘要；設一個到價條件就好。台股日報自選股到價提醒</li><li>第 6 天：用歷史日練手練功房只檢討你自己的單，不拿來當今日明牌；訪客也可先試玩。練功房學堂：練功房猜下一根</li><li>第 7 天：法遵與客服入口確認不是投資建議，並知道刪帳與客服在哪。法遵與風險問大佬AI隱私權</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">依目的再往下</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">第一次來：三個地方就夠</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：剛開始用，還不知道從哪下手</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/diary\">今日戰情 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 今日戰情看漲跌家數；首頁「今日精華」再收幾張摘要。</li><li>2. 台股日報每晚出，兩分鐘讀完當天。</li><li>3. 名詞去學堂查。收盤後現價不動，先看「資料日」。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">產業地圖 ↔ 族群熱圖</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：想先看整條產業鏈，再對照官方族群強弱</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/diary\">產業地圖 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 產業地圖點進產業看成分股熱力格。</li><li>2. 再跳族群熱圖，對照官方產業分類（可深鏈自動展開）。</li><li>3. 想查單檔就從熱力格進個股盯盤。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">首頁是功能格子</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：打開 App 不知道該點哪一頁</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/\">首頁 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 上面是指數、漲跌家數與今日精華，下面一格進一頁。</li><li>2. 產業地圖、族群熱圖、練功房都在格子裡。左上「返回」隨時能回來。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">想被通知、不想被吵</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：不能整天盯盤，只想在關鍵時被叫一聲</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/review\">到價提醒 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 先設「到價」或「站上／跌破均線」。</li><li>2. 怕冷門股洗版，到戰情室警報勾「沒量的不要推」。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">大盤跌一波：融資維持率</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：想知道借錢買股的人被壓多緊</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/chips/2330\">融資維持率 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 維持率＝擔保品市值 ÷ 借的錢。低於 130% 可能被要求補錢。</li><li>2. 低不代表明天斷頭，也不代表跌完就反彈。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">盤中觀察波動</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：想掌握異常波動，但不希望通知過多</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/radar\">事件雷達 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 事件雷達整理已發生的波動、漲跌停、處置與鉅額交易。</li><li>2. 資券借券只比較餘額，不把單日增減當成買賣答案。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">分點研究</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：想理解券商分點行為與歷史樣本</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/radar\">隔日沖分點股 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 隔日沖分點股顯示次日反向賣超的歷史樣本與資料日。</li><li>2. 樣本過少時不做推論。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">中長期：持股與基本事件</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：偏好週期較長、重視資料連續性</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/chips/2330\">波段條件 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 波段條件比較不同持股級距的週資料變化。</li><li>2. 除權息看公開行事曆與填權息歷史，注意參考價調整。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">事件研究</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：重視公告、處置、除權息及市場事件</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/radar\">事件雷達 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 先確認事件時間、來源，以及是否已反映在當日成交。</li><li>2. 處置股名單用公開制度資料說明風險，不預測漲跌。</li></ul></div><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><p class=\"StaticPage_cardTitle__l5OLi\">模擬與覆盤</p><p class=\"StaticPage_cardBody__JO4cj\">適合：希望用歷史回放練習並建立紀律</p><a class=\"StaticPage_cardCta__CiSXm\" href=\"/sim\">練功房 →</a><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 練功房用真實歷史逐筆回放；訪客可試玩，正式紀錄請登入。</li><li>2. 只檢討你已完成的模擬單，不提供下一筆喊單。</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">所有功能都適用的原則</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><div class=\"StaticPage_card__Jx1EJ\"><ul class=\"StaticPage_cardItems__3CvkW\"><li>1. 本站所有內容都是「歷史統計＋研究情境」，不是明牌，沒有人能保證漲跌。</li><li>2. 同時核對日期、樣本數與資料來源，避免用單一指標解釋全部行情。</li><li>3. 標「⚠ 量&lt;3000張」代表流動性較低，統計容易受少數成交影響。</li><li>4. 放空、槓桿與衍生商品可能造成超過預期的損失，請先理解制度風險。</li><li>5. 資料時效：籌碼類為盤後統計（每晚 21:30 更新）；行情類盤中即時。</li><li>6. App 到「通知中心」選主題，並允許手機通知；完整內容保留在收件匣。</li></ul></div></div></section></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer mx-auto mt-14 w-full max-w-[1360px] px-4 md:px-6\"><div class=\"data-panel rounded-2xl border border-line/80 bg-surface/70 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 font-bold text-ink\">免責與法遵聲明</p><p>本平台提供台股公開籌碼資料之統計、教學與研究工具，所有數字均為歷史資料整理，<span class=\"font-bold text-ink\">不構成任何投資建議、招攬、買賣要約或獲利保證</span>。平台不代客操作、不提供個股買賣訊號、不保證準確性。 投資有風險，交易前請自行評估、獨立判斷並自負盈虧。 本站不會私訊要驗證碼或叫你匯款。</p><nav aria-label=\"公司資訊與法遵\" class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 text-[12.5px] font-bold mt-3\"><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/about\">關於本站</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/guide\">新手導覽</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/privacy\">隱私權政策</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/terms\">服務條款</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/legal\">法遵說明</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/member/?tab=feedback\">使用回饋／刪帳</a></nav></div><p class=\"mt-3 pb-2 text-center text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-muted\">股市大佬 TradeBoss · © 2026 資料研究工具｜非投資建議</p></footer><nav aria-label=\"手機導覽（未登入）\" class=\"mobile-taskbar fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 grid h-[calc(4.5rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] grid-cols-5 border-t border-line bg-surface/96 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] backdrop-blur-xl lg:hidden\"><a class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 text-[11px] font-black transition active:scale-95 text-muted\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid place-items-center rounded-full transition-all duration-200 h-7 w-10 text-current\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"